 "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. avnier.com declares its palette as Shopify scheme custom properties on :root (css-vars.json's `app` bin); they land under descriptive core.color families. The light set holds only roles a measurement verified — each resolves through a var whose value equals a colour read off a live component. The shop paints one light theme (a .dark probe resolves identically; .color-inverse sections invert the same two colours), so dark is empty. A leaf with \"var\" resolves through the live document; \"value\" leaves are measured on the running page.",
